      "text": "G / 查询与通知（规划）\nGET /v1/deposits\nGET /v1/balances\ndeposit.risk_pending / credited / held\n链确认 / 风控 / 入账状态分别返回",
      "originalText": "G / 查询与通知（规划）\nGET /v1/deposits\nGET /v1/balances\ndeposit.risk_pending / credited / held\n链确认 / 风控 / 入账状态分别返回",
